    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Start Date Of Return Window</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specifies the start date of the return window during which a product may be returned for a refund or voidance. Assigned domain=Policy, range=xsd:date; The return window start date is a time-bound feature tied to a policy…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Specifies the start date of the return window during which a product may be returned for a refund or voidance.</skos:definition>
