    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Accelerated benefit payment is constrained by a specified limit. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence indicates a maximum limit on accelerated benefit payments, implying a cardinality constraint on the…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder excluded from coverage for war-related claims. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies that claims from war-related activities are excluded, and this exclusion is formalized as a cl…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Death by suicide within two years excludes claim eligibility. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property defines a claim exclusion for suicide within two years, consistent with the range Exclusion. The evide…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A type of insurance providing financial benefits upon the insured's death within a specified term.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#DeathBenefit"/>
