    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A provision in a life insurance policy that specifies conditions or circumstances not covered by the policy. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf ContractualProvision (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 1 surface vari…</rdfs:comment>
