    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A contract provision enabling early or partial payout upon diagnosis of a specified condition. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf RIDER; cluster of 2 surfac…</rdfs:comment>
